        <h1>
          How <em>HR Teams</em> Use Spin Wheels for
          <em>Employee Recognition</em> &amp; Office Events
        </h1>

        <div class="article-meta">
          <span>⏱ 12 min read</span>
          <span>📂 HR &amp; Workplace Events</span>
          <span>✅ Last reviewed: November 24, 2026</span>
        </div>

        <p class="lead">
          Recognition programmes rarely fail because a company doesn't care —
          they fail because the process behind them is invisible. Nobody sees
          how a name was chosen, so nobody fully trusts the result. A growing
          number of HR teams have started running recognition, prize draws, and
          office activities through a free spin wheel instead, precisely because
          the whole team can watch the decision happen in real time.
        </p>

        <figure class="hero-image">
